---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact - Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide | Email & Feedback"
  description="Get in touch with the Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide team. We welcome questions, corrections, and stories from your panda visit."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-accent-600 uppercase mb-3">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-warm-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
      Get in Touch
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-warm-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Have a question, correction, or a story from your own visit to Dujiangyan? We would love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent-600">
            <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M22 4L12 13 2 4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-warm-900">Email Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-warm-600 leading-relaxed">
          Send us a message at <a href="mailto:hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com</a>. We typically respond within 2-3 days.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent-600">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-warm-900">Corrections</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-warm-600 leading-relaxed">
          If you notice outdated prices, hours, or booking information, please let us know. We update our content regularly based on reader feedback and direct visits to the base.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent-600">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/>
            <path d="M14 2v6h6M16 13H8M16 17H8M10 9H8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-warm-900">Share Your Story</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-warm-600 leading-relaxed">
          Volunteered at the base or recently visited? We welcome reader stories and photos. If we publish your experience, we will credit you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent-600">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 015.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3M12 17h.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-warm-900">Not Official</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-warm-600 leading-relaxed">
          This guide is independently produced and not affiliated with the official Dujiangyan Panda Base. For official inquiries, please contact the base directly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
